@startuml
title UC04 - credit the specified account (REVIEW)
autonumber
actor "Authorized CSKH" as C
participant "Credit service" as S
participant "Operation outcomes" as O
participant "Specified account" as A
participant "Financial history" as L
C -> S : requestId, subscriberId, accountId, amountVND
S -> O : caller + UC04 + ID / canonical target and amount
alt replay / content conflict / PROCESSING
 O --> S : original outcome / conflict / in progress
 S --> C : no second monetary effect
else new operation
 group atomic business effect
  S -> A : verify owner/type/CREDIT permission and ACTIVE
  S -> A : check DB time under account coordination immediately before update
  alt expired / amount invalid / new balance exceeds configured cap
   A --> S : business rejection
   S -> O : FAILED, unchanged balance
  else eligible and within cap
   S -> A : add exact integer amount to this account
   S -> L : CREDIT_TOPUP, recordedAt, eligibilityCheckedAt, balances
   S -> O : SUCCEEDED linked to ledger
  end
 end
 S --> C : outcome only after commit
end
note over S,A
 No fallback to MAIN or another subsidiary.
 checkedAt before expiry can commit after expiry.
 credit does not reactivate an expired account or failed renewal.
end note
@enduml
